Files for various electronic design tools that were used to design this board.

opa310-preamp-sallenkey.tsc

  TINA-TI (https://www.ti.com/tool/TINA-TI) SPICE circuit simulation for
  microphone pre-amp with Sallen-Key filter.

opa310.sp

  TI OPA310 SPICE subcircuit model (extracted from TINA-TI model provided by TI)

anti-alias-sallenkey.flt

  Microchip FilterLab Sallen-Key filter design.
  (https://www.microchip.com/en-us/development-tool/filterlabdesignsoftware)

preamp-sallenkey.asc

  LTspice circuit simulation for microphone pre-amp with Sallen-Key filter. Note
  that a generic op-amp component is used in the simulation, rather than the
  specific SPICE model for the OPAx310, as is used in the TINA-TI simulation, so
  it may be less accurate.
  (https://www.analog.com/en/design-center/design-tools-and-calculators/ltspice-simulator.html)

opa310-preamp-sallenkey.asc

  LTspice circuit simulation as above but using the OPA310 SPICE model
  (OPA2310.asy).
